            {
              "content": "=Classify the following government opportunity:\n\nTitle: {{$json.title}}\nDescription: {{$json.description || \"\"}}\n\nInstructions:\n1. Determine if this is IT-related (software, cloud, data, cybersecurity, etc.)\n2. Determine if this opportunity is HUBZone eligible:\n   - Explicitly HUBZone set-aside OR\n   - Likely HUBZone based on small business / federal contracting context\n\nAnswer ONLY in JSON format:\n\n{\n  \"isIT\": true/false,\n  \"isHubzone\": true/false,\n  \"confidence\": 0-100\n}\n\nReturn ONLY raw JSON. Do NOT use markdown or code blocks."
            }
